<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-114-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.452197" lon="-121.008051"><name>SC26-114-B</name><cmt>SC26-114</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 7.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 64/100; not catch probability. Center 83 ft; nearby 80–101 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-091</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.455321572850174" lon="-121.00891065743036"/><trkpt lat="35.45506576830256" lon="-121.00979839171904"/><trkpt lat="35.45445132003463" lon="-121.01080512962781"/><trkpt lat="35.4539088257062" lon="-121.01070830981422"/><trkpt lat="35.45381326553633" lon="-121.01038013175041"/><trkpt lat="35.453452813032754" lon="-121.0103890085677"/><trkpt lat="35.45343464998219" lon="-121.00928769103098"/><trkpt lat="35.453072380862345" lon="-121.00918644138737"/><trkpt lat="35.45306874689486" lon="-121.00896617899912"/><trkpt lat="35.45244340613725" lon="-121.00931211495615"/><trkpt lat="35.45190091084644" lon="-121.00921530697987"/><trkpt lat="35.451904544256074" lon="-121.00943556621903"/><trkpt lat="35.45136204901277" lon="-121.00933875787813"/><trkpt lat="35.45137113110175" lon="-121.00988940242027"/><trkpt lat="35.4511007